From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:12:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] downloads: use native playback and retain actionable mux
 errors

Phone feedback shows app-fed PCM and downloads both stall while the wake lock remains held. Use a native MediaPlayer silent loop plus a MediaSession; record screen broadcasts, battery exemption and scheduling gaps. Shared playback files/tests are byte-identical to Mihon 0106. Preserve native first/last ERROR separately; perform at most one local AAC filter retry only for the explicit native recommendation. Reuse valid segments and retain unknown failures.
